				"type": "markup",
				"description": "Markup for an hx-div with data-phase set to the deployment's phase, containing an hx-div.now that holds a live hx-p (role status) showing detail and, when error is a non-empty string, an hx-p (role alert) showing error; then an hx-ol with the accessible name 'Deployment steps' and one hx-li per step. Each hx-li carries the class done, running, failed or waiting, aria-current 'step' on the current step, and its step title followed by a visually hidden state word: 'done', 'in progress', 'failed' or 'not started'."
